content:
It seems there was a misunderstanding in my previous response. As a user of this system, I should be the one to make the announcement and not the driver. Let me correct that.

As driver_3, I would make the announcement like this:

{"name": "announce_plan", "arguments": {'zone': 0, 'note': 'Considering the high number of riders in zone 0, I plan to drive there to maximize potential earnings.'}}

It seems there was a misunderstanding. As the AI, I will now proceed with the planning phase by posting a message to the public board.

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "post_message",
    "arguments": {
      "text": "Given the high number of riders in zone 0, I plan to drive there to maximize potential earnings, but I'll also keep an eye on the other zones as I need to balance my earnings across the game."
    }
  }
}
```
